OL,3,GNEWSAFast family launch high-value
OL,4,Anumber plate challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive members of a family named Fast are
OL,7,Feach attempting to buy the best car
OL,8,Fnumber plate featuring their surname.
OL,10,FDad Sacha Fast, from Yate near Bristol,
OL,11,Fstarted by purchasing a plate for his
OL,12,Fcarpentry van saying FA55 TYS eight
OL,13,Fyears ago, because his football friends
OL,14,Fcalled him Fasty.
OL,16,FInspired by his father, Oakley then
OL,17,Fbought his first fast-themed plate,
OL,18,FFA57 TYS. His two brothers and mum
OL,19,Flater joined the challenge, with the
OL,20,Ffamily now spending up to #4,000 per
OL,21,Fnumber plate.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
