OL,3,GNEWSAFast family launch high-value
OL,4,Anumber plate challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FOakley said: "These number plates are
OL,7,Fquite hard to get. They're on fast cars
OL,8,Flike Ferraris and Lamborghinis. The
OL,9,Fmillionaires and high-value people have
OL,10,Fgot them on their cars."
